      "subtask_answer": "We have:\n\n- \\(|\\pi - 3.14| = \\pi - 3.14\\) (since \\(\\pi > 3.14\\))\n- \\(|\\pi - \\frac{22}{7}| = \\frac{22}{7} - \\pi\\) (since \\(\\frac{22}{7} > \\pi\\))\n\nSo:\n\n\\[\n|\\pi - 3.14| + \\left|\\pi - \\frac{22}{7}\\right| = (\\pi - 3.14) + \\left(\\frac{22}{7} - \\pi\\right)\n\\]\n\nThe \\(\\pi\\) terms cancel:\n\n\\[\n= \\frac{22}{7} - 3.14\n\\]\n\nNow, \\(3.14 = \\frac{314}{100} = \\frac{157}{50}\\).\n\nSo:\n\n\\[\n\\frac{22}{7} - \\frac{157}{50} = \\frac{22 \\cdot 50 - 157 \\cdot 7}{350} = \\frac{1100 - 1099}{350} = \\frac{1}{350}\n\\]\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{\\frac{1}{350}}\n\\]",
